<title>JAPAN: Japan rubber stocks rise at end-Sept from August.</title>
<headline>Japan rubber stocks rise at end-Sept from August.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>End-September rubber stock figures issued by the Japan Rubber Trade Association, with month- earlier and year-earlier comparisons, in tonnes:</p>
<p>    Month	   Sept 96   Aug 96  Sept 95</p>
<p>    Stocks	   54,016   48,653   32,017</p>
<p>Breakdown of stocks, in tonnes:</p>
<p>    Crude rubber   47,873   41,869   25,652</p>
<p>    Synthetic	 6,043    6,708    6,302</p>
<p>    Latex		 100	 76	 63</p>
</text>
